---
title: Bamboo
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, sherry]
source: Classic cocktail, number 17 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #mixing cup{}(with ice), pour @dry sherry{1.5%fl_oz} and @dry vermouth{1.5%fl_oz}. Add @Angostura bitters{2%dashes} and @orange bitters{2%dashes}. Stir well, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with a @lemon peel{1%twist}.

> Fino or manzanilla sherry. Low in alcohol, so it works before dinner.
